  <p class="page-kicker">Head to head</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">SABRENT SATA-to-USB Cable vs Lay-Flat Drive Dock (NVMe + SATA)</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Both let you access a bare drive from your computer without permanently mounting it. The cable is $10 and does one thing: SATA-to-USB, one drive at a time. The lay-flat dock is $40 and reads SATA HDDs, SATA SSDs, and NVMe drives without tools. Pick based on how often you swap drives.</p>

